consider both algebras, $\gt z(\wg,t)$ and  $\gt z(\wg,t^{-1})$. They are isomorphic and 
an isomorphism is given by the change of variable $t^{-1}\mapsto t$. 
The use of $\gt z(\wg,t)$ makes 
