Define a new Lie algebra structure on the vector space $\q$ and associated Lie--Poisson bracket by 
\beq       \label{eq:fi_s}
      [x, y]_{(s)}=\{x,y\}_{(s)}:=\vp_s^{-1}[\vp_s( x), \vp_s( y)], \ x,y \in \q, \ s\in\bbk^{\!^\times}.
