with $1\le i\le r$ and $0\le j<n$. Furthermore,  
\[
\tilde\vth(H_{rj+i})=\omega^{(n-1)j} \tilde\zeta^{\ell_i} H_{rj+i}, \ \ \text{ where } \ \ 
