\caption{Trajectories of electrons in perturbed FRC projected onto the $x$--$y$ plane. Unit in each axis is cm. Time is denoted by color. $\alpha = 0.1$, $I = 0.1$, $r_s = 25$ cm, $z_s = 75$ cm, $s\sim800$, $T=2\times10^5\tau_{ce}$ }
