n_{(0,2),D_4}&=\frac{p-1}{8}-\frac{1-\left(\frac{-1}{p}\right)}{8}-\frac{1-\left(\frac{-2}{p}\right)}{4}-\frac{1-\left(\frac{-3}{p}\right)}{2},\\
