% \(\lfloor\frac{\alpha}{2}(n_{2}+1)\rfloor\)th and
% \(\lceil{\bigl(1-\frac{\alpha}{2}\bigr)(n_{2}+1)}\rceil\)th smallest of
% \(R_{i},i\in\mathcal{D}_{2}\), respectively. 
