Finally, we have derived the gravitational amplitude modes, following the algorithm presented in Secs.~\ref{sec:asymptotic_waveform} and~\ref{sec:memory}. In particular, we have computed all the memory $m=0$ modes for the first time in ST theories, including both point-particle and tidal contributions. 

