The point-particle part of the gravitational modes $\hat{H}^\text{pp}_{\ell m}$ were derived up to 2PN order in~\cite{Sennett:2016klh}. Here, we present the non-vanishing tidal corrections to the gravitational modes, computed at the relative 1PN order:
