	By Lemma~\ref{thm:weakconvergence_Y}(b), we have \(\delta_{n,m} \to 0\), as \( n, m \to \infty \). Thus:
	\[
	\sup_{l \in [0, \bar{l}]} |\hat{r}_3(l) - r_3(l)| \to 0.
