\begin{lemma}\label{ch2-lem1}
    For any vertex $v\in VG$ and any two non-empty paths $p,q\in\mathcal{T}(G,R)$ ending in the same vertex $v$, if we have 
        \[\mathcal{T}(G,R)^p\cong\mathcal{T}(G,R)^q,\]
    then there exists an isomorphism
        \[\phi:\mathcal{T}(G,R)^p\to\mathcal{T}(G,R)^q,\] 
