	Here, it follows from \cite[Page 34]{Pla13} that the bottom map $\mu_k$ in Diagram \eqref{6FUzaTwbFh77} sends $g^{a}=(g_1,g_2,\cdots,g_n)$ with $a\in K^{\{-1,0\}}(\proj\mathcal{J}(Q,W))$ to $g^{F_k(a)}=(g'_1,g'_2,\cdots,g'_n)$, where
