			\Biggl\{\begin{gathered}\text{Tagged triangulations in $\mathcal{S}$ with}\\\text{the same tags as those in $T$}\end{gathered}\Biggr\}
			\longrightarrow\Cluster(Q_T),
			\]
			which sends $T$ to the initial cluster in $\mathcal{A}(Q_T)$ and commutes with flips and mutations.
