 with radiation-reaction included to $O(\varkappa^3)$ (dotted curve), resp. to
 $O(\varkappa^4)$ (continuous curve), when $\varkappa e^2/\mbare c^2 = -2$.
 Also shown is the radiation-free motion of a ``charge soliton,'' 
