Based on \textbf{Table \ref{Table1}}, we can estimate the following constant
\begin{equation}\label{DefCn0}
    C_{n_{0}}  :=  \frac{1}{4  \pi}   \lambda_{n_{0}}^{-2} \left( \int_{B} e_{n_{0}}(x) dx \right)^{2}  \varepsilon^{1-h},
\end{equation}
which, combined with $(\ref{BSD-1})$, gives us
\begin{equation}\label{BSD-1-Algo}
 v^{\infty}(-  \theta, \theta, \omega_{n_0})  -  u^{\infty}_z(-  \theta, \theta, \omega_{n_{0}})  = C_{n_{0}} \,   \left( v(z,\theta, \omega_{n_0}) \right)^{2}.
\end{equation}
